{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1482021-so-aliens-in-the-clades-companion","id":1482021,"title":"So... Aliens in the clades companion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-26T13:01:38-07:00","id":1482021,"title":"So... Aliens in the clades companion","content":"I have heard about aliens being something that will be in the clade companion, what do people mean by that? And where are they getting this information from?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-26T16:01:40-07:00","id":1482032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anyoneatall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1482021-so-aliens-in-the-clades-companion#post1482021\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have heard about aliens being something that will be in the clade companion, what do people mean by that? And where are they getting this information from?</div> </div> </div> </div>I cannot explain anything until it's released. But I'm getting it from being the writer of that section.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Well, okay, I can mention that it's a Form called Outsider, which is based on non-human things being shoved into icksy, squishy, and <i>badly developed</i> human forms (or others, if you pick up some of the other Forms). Sometimes by human conspiracies, sometimes by their own, sometimes on their own.<br /> <br /> I can otherwise mention I had some personal ambitions, particularly in relation to &quot;but I want to play an alien&quot; commentary, but that's where the commentary stops for now.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Okay, one other tidbit, the first thing I reached for for writing that section was the Visitor mononoke from the Golden Sky Stories supplement Twilight Tales. It wasn't a hard goal to make it so everything there could be represented, but it definitely formed a spiritual backbone for the section.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 05-26-2022, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-27T04:39:33-07:00","id":1482066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1482021-so-aliens-in-the-clades-companion?p=1482032#post1482032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I cannot explain anything until it's released. But I'm getting it from being the writer of that section.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Well, okay, I can mention that it's a Form called Outsider, which is based on non-human things being shoved into icksy, squishy, and <i>badly developed</i> human forms (or others, if you pick up some of the other Forms). Sometimes by human conspiracies, sometimes by their own, sometimes on their own.<br /> <br /> I can otherwise mention I had some personal ambitions, particularly in relation to &amp;quot;but I want to play an alien&amp;quot; commentary, but that's where the commentary stops for now.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Okay, one other tidbit, the first thing I reached for for writing that section was the Visitor mononoke from the Golden Sky Stories supplement Twilight Tales. It wasn't a hard goal to make it so everything there could be represented, but it definitely formed a spiritual backbone for the section.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know you probably can't talk about this but is this going to allow an alien from an ufo or it's going to be for weirder things?<br /> <br /> If that's something you can't say i understand it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-27T05:47:04-07:00","id":1482069,"title":"","content":"Among other things, the Outsider Form is meant to enable stories about extraterrestrials who are marooned or exiled on Earth and are pursued by human organizations that seek to study them. E.T. is the obvious and most spot-on example. It isn't going to establish the existence of any specific alien civilizations or anything, although troupes are welcome to do that at their tables.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-27T05:48:35-07:00","id":1482070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1482021-so-aliens-in-the-clades-companion?p=1482069#post1482069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Among other things, the Outsider Form is meant to enable stories about extraterrestrials who are marooned or exiled on Earth and are pursued by human organizations that seek to study them. E.T. is the obvious and most spot-on example. It isn't going to establish the existence of any specific alien civilizations or anything, although troupes are welcome to do that at their tables.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok i get it, waiting to see how it comes out","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-12T04:56:27-07:00","id":1483784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Zawadzki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1482021-so-aliens-in-the-clades-companion?p=1482069#post1482069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Among other things, the Outsider Form is meant to enable stories about extraterrestrials who are marooned or exiled on Earth and are pursued by human organizations that seek to study them. E.T. is the obvious and most spot-on example. It isn't going to establish the existence of any specific alien civilizations or anything, although troupes are welcome to do that at their tables.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know you can't tell much about this, but is there going to be any option to represent them having some superadvanced technology?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":